{"name":"perm_gap_sum","v":1,"source_hash":"fff1db4afa5455ac","lines":["n : ℕ","σ : Equiv.Perm (Fin n)","⊢ (((∑ a, ∑ b, if ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b then 1 else 0) + ∑ b, if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then 1 else 0) +","      ∑ b, if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑(σ b) else 0) =","    ∑ b, if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑b else 0","⊢ ∑ x,","      (((∑ x_1, if ↑(σ x) < ↑x_1 ∧ ↑x_1 < ↑x then 1 else 0) + if ↑(σ x) < ↑x then 1 else 0) +","        if ↑(σ x) < ↑x then ↑(σ x) else 0) =","b : Fin n","x✝ : b ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ (((∑ x, if ↑(σ b) < ↑x ∧ ↑x < ↑b then 1 else 0) + if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then 1 else 0) + if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑(σ b) else 0) =","    if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑b else 0","hc : (∑ a, if ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b then 1 else 0) = ↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1","⊢ (∑ a, if ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b then 1 else 0) = ↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1","⊢ {i | ↑(σ b) < ↑i ∧ ↑i < ↑b}.card = ↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1","this : {a | ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b} = Finset.Ioo (σ b) b","⊢ {a | ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b} = Finset.Ioo (σ b) b","a : Fin n","⊢ a ∈ {a | ↑(σ b) < ↑a ∧ ↑a < ↑b} ↔ a ∈ Finset.Ioo (σ b) b","⊢ ((↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1 + if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then 1 else 0) + if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑(σ b) else 0) = if ↑(σ b) < ↑b then ↑b else 0","case pos","h✝ : ↑(σ b) < ↑b","⊢ ↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1 + 1 + ↑(σ b) = ↑b","case neg","h✝ : ¬↑(σ b) < ↑b","⊢ ↑b - ↑(σ b) - 1 + 0 + 0 = 0"],"goals":[[0,1,2,3,4],[0,1,5,6,7,4],[0,1,8,9,10,11],[0,1,8,9,12,10,11],[0,1,8,9,13],[0,1,8,9,14],[0,1,8,9,15,14],[0,1,8,9,16],[0,1,8,9,17,18],[0,1,8,9,12,19],[20,0,1,8,9,12,21,22],[23,0,1,8,9,12,24,25]],"steps":[{"line":6,"col":2,"end_line":6,"end_col":74,"tactic":"rw [Finset.sum_comm, ← Finset.sum_add_distrib, ← Finset.sum_add_distrib]","before":[0],"after":[1],"used":["Eq.mpr","Equiv.instEquivLike","Finset.univ","congrArg","Finset.sum_add_distrib","AddMonoid.toAddZeroClass","AddZeroClass.toAddZero","id","instOfNatNat","Fin.val","Fin.fintype","instHAdd","And","HAdd.hAdd","Equiv.Perm","Nat","LT.lt","Nat.decLt","instAddNat","Nat.instAddCommMonoid","AddZero.toAdd","AddCommMonoid.toAddMonoid","instLTNat","instDecidableAnd"]}